SUMMARY:Apostles Academy Concert: Harmony 3
DESCRIPTION:Everyone is invited to join us in Rader Park on July 12 at 3 PM for a free community concert featuring Harmony 3\, a New York City–based reed trio\, joined by internationally acclaimed jazz vocalist Yaala Ballin. Together\, they’ll present a joyful and inspiring program celebrating women’s voices through music\, storytelling\, and artistic collaboration. Bring a lawn chair or blanket and enjoy an afternoon of beautiful music and community in the park!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/apostles-academy-concert-harmony-3/
LOCATION:Rader Park\, 1899 Apostles Way\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026-Summer-Concert-Series-Postcard.jpg
END:VEVENT
